---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who Maxime is and what he likes to build.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Nice to meet you</p>
      <h1>🧑‍🔬 About me</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm <strong>Maxime</strong>. I'm 8 years old and I love figuring out how things work —
        usually by taking them apart first.
      </p>
      <h2>Things I like 💛</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Building machines out of cardboard, LEGO and tape</li>
        <li>Making games on the computer</li>
        <li>Space, volcanoes and very big numbers</li>
        <li>Asking "but <em>why</em>?"</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Things I'm learning 🧠</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Python</strong> — my first programming language</li>
        <li><strong>Swift</strong> — for making iPhone apps</li>
        <li>How to finish a project before starting three new ones</li>
      </ul>
      <blockquote>
        My rule: if it doesn't work the first time, that's not failing. That's data.
      </blockquote>
      <h2>Say hello 👋</h2>
      <p>
        A grown-up reads my messages first, so ask your grown-up to write to
        <a href="mailto:hello@maximecousot.com">hello@maximecousot.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
